From 3d4290e44462472dda8e8945970730cdbfa0207a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mirko Brombin <9479903+mirkobrombin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 18 Jul 2026 19:13:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] mm: add generation-checked native object tiers

Register FD-scoped declarative tiers through /dev/mts and keep provider identity behind the MTS object interface. Store authoritative pages by slot, validate every fill with CRC32, and reject stale generations.

Preserve exact fork references through the 24-bit sticky freeze boundary. Drain a provider before removing its global tier slot so an in-flight lookup cannot observe freed state.

Evidence: CONFIG_MTS_OBSERVE=y CONFIG_MTS_TIER=y make -j4 mm/mts.o mm/mts_tier.o.
Signed-off-by: Mirko Brombin <9479903+mirkobrombin@users.noreply.github.com>
